  "rationale": "Prospectively test a materially distinct event-driven volatility-expansion mechanism after C026 showed gross-positive but cost-dominated recurring session drift. C027 does not filter or retune C026 winners. It uses only completed-bar 6-hour channel structure plus a fixed 30-minute expansion condition and a cost-scaled minimum move, then holds for a fixed 3-hour horizon. Parameters are frozen before C027 outcome and were not fitted to C026 numeric PnL.",
